Status bar: press and release feedback through meegofeedbackd

The Qt 4 status bar played the theme's press and release effects (priority2_static_press,
priority2_static_release, at least 150 ms apart: mstatusbarstyle.css). The port talks to
meegofeedbackd's socket directly, as libmeegotouch's MFeedbackPlayer does.

